The course is seperated into 6 chapters with the last being a final exam. 
To be able to study this course, it is required to understand Greek very well + basic English.

You also need to take into account that a mobile phone is required. You will need an application called "ARTutor". ARTutor uses AR technologies to make the learnig process
more interactive and fun. ARTutor is free and you can find it in Google playstore (not sure if it also exists in the App store).
